{"id": "3247500", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3247500", "title": "Hiroshi Tanahashi", "text": "Hiroshi Tanahashi (\u68da\u6a4b\u5f18\u81f3, Tanahashi Hiroshi; ) un wrestler profesionist japonez, director sportiv \u0219i podcaster. Este semnat cu New Japan Pro-Wrestling (NJPW), unde este pre\u0219edinte \u0219i director reprezentativ al promo\u021biei \u0219i este, de asemenea, un wrestler activ.\nConsiderat pe scar\u0103 larg\u0103 ca unul dintre cei mai mari wrestleri profesioni\u0219ti din toate timpurile, printre distinc\u021biile sale din NJPW se num\u0103r\u0103 un record de opt domnii ca IWGP Heavyweight Champion, un record de trei domnii ca IWGP United States Heavyweight Champion, dou\u0103 domnii ca IWGP Intercontinental Champion, o domnie ca NJPW World Television Champion, trei domnii ca IWGP Tag Team Champion, o domnie ca NEVER Openweight Champion \u0219i \u0219ase domnii ca NEVER Openweight 6-Man Tag Team Champion. \u00cen total, Tanahashi a c\u00e2\u0219tigat 26 de centuri \u00een NJPW. De asemenea, a c\u00e2\u0219tigat G1 Climax, turneul principal al NJPW, \u00een trei ocazii (2007, 2015 \u0219i 2018), a c\u00e2\u0219tigat New Japan Cup de dou\u0103 ori (2005 \u0219i 2008) \u0219i este recunoscut ca al patrulea lupt\u0103tor care a ob\u021binut Tripla Coroan\u0103 NJPW \u0219i al doilea care a ob\u021binut Grand Slam-ul, ceea ce \u00eel face unul dintre cei mai decora\u021bi lupt\u0103tori din NJPW.\nPrin acordurile de lucru ale NJPW cu Consejo Mundial de Lucha Libre (CMLL), Pro Wrestling NOAH, Ring of Honor (ROH), All Elite Wrestling (AEW) \u0219i Revolution Pro Wrestling, Tanahashi a de\u021binut, de asemenea, CMLL World Tag Team Championship, CMLL World Trios Championship, CMLL Universal Championship, GHC Tag Team Championship \u0219i RevPro British Heavyweight Championship. \u00centre NJPW, CMLL, Noah, ROH \u0219i RevPro, are 27 de domnii de campion.\nC\u00e2nd Tanahashi a fost inclus \u00een Wrestling Observer Hall of Fame \u00een 2013, Dave Meltzer a declarat c\u0103 \u201ese poate argumenta puternic c\u0103 este cel mai bun lupt\u0103tor din ring din industrie \u00een prezent\u201d, ad\u0103ug\u00e2nd c\u0103 a fost \u201evedeta principal\u0103 a revenirii New Japan Pro-Wrestling de la o form\u0103 groaznic\u0103 \u00een urm\u0103 cu c\u00e2\u021biva ani la a fi a doua companie de wrestling profesionist din lume\u201d. Cititorii buletinului informativ Wrestling Observer l-au numit pe Tanahashi cel mai bun lupt\u0103tor al anilor 2010 \u00een martie 2020."}
